{"run_id":"arm2-rag-base-q8","qa_id":"hw-pmkmy-02-hi","output":{"answer":{"text":"पीएम-केएमवाई में हर महीने कितना योगदान देना होता है? इस प्रश्न के उत्तर के लिए उपलब्ध जानकारी में निर्दिष्ट दिशानियों और विवरणों के आधार पर, पीएम-केएमवाई में लघु और सीमाांत ककसानों के लिए एक सामाच्जक सुरक्षा कवच सृच्जत करने की जरूरत महसूस की गई है क्योंकि वृद्धावस्था में अधधकाांश ककसानों की आजीपवका के साधन नह ां रह जाते। इसके अलावा, पीएम-केएमवाई में लघु और सीमाांत ककसानों के लिए एक सुननच्च चत मालसक पेंशन की व् यवस् था की गई है।","citations":["pm-kmy:d0-page-16:0"],"refused":false},"retrieved":["pm-kmy:d0-page-16:0","pm-kmy:d0-page-20:1","pm-kmy:d0-page-16:1","pm-kmy:d0-page-20:0","pm-kmy:d0-page-29:0"],"usage":[{"requested_model":"qwen3-1.7b-base:q8_0","served_model":"qwen3-1.7b-base:q8_0","input_tokens":3715,"output_tokens":423,"latency_s":496.1247989000003,"cost_usd":0.0}],"latency_s":496.9943899,"parse_error":null}}
{"run_id":"arm2-rag-base-q8","qa_id":"hw-pmuy-04-en","output":{"answer":{"text":"Yes, the first LPG refill is free under PMUY. The scheme provides the first refill and stove free of cost along with the deposit free connection by OMCs.","citations":["pmuy:d1-frequently-asked-questions-on-ujjwala-sc:1","pmuy:d1-pmuy-benefits:0"],"refused":false},"retrieved":["pmuy:d1-frequently-asked-questions-on-ujjwala-sc:2","pmuy:d0-pmuy-benefits:0","pmuy:d1-frequently-asked-questions-on-ujjwala-sc:1","pmuy:d1-pmuy-benefits:0","pmuy:d1-frequently-asked-questions-on-ujjwala-sc:0"],"usage":[{"requested_model":"qwen3-1.7b-base:q8_0","served_model":"qwen3-1.7b-base:q8_0","input_tokens":1110,"output_tokens":86,"latency_s":92.5339269999995,"cost_usd":0.0}],"latency_s":94.60979740000039,"parse_error":null}}
