{"run_id":"arm2-rag-base-q8","qa_id":"hw-pmuy-01-hinglish","output":{"answer":{"text":"The Pradhan Mantri Ujjwala Yojana (PMUY) provides free LPG connections to rural and deprived households. The scheme includes a cash assistance of Rs. 1600 for 14.2 kg cylinders and Rs. 1150 for 5 kg cylinders. Beneficiaries receive a free first LPG refill and stove. The scheme was launched in 2016 and aims to reduce traditional cooking fuels.","citations":["pmuy:d0-swachh-indhan-behtar-jeevan:1","pmuy:d0-pmuy-benefits:0","pmuy:d1-frequently-asked-questions-on-ujjwala-sc:1"],"refused":false},"retrieved":["pmuy:d0-swachh-indhan-behtar-jeevan:1","pmuy:d0-pmuy-benefits:0","pmuy:d1-pmuy-benefits:0","pmuy:d0-swachh-indhan-behtar-jeevan:0","pmuy:d1-frequently-asked-questions-on-ujjwala-sc:1"],"usage":[{"requested_model":"qwen3-1.7b-base:q8_0","served_model":"qwen3-1.7b-base:q8_0","input_tokens":1119,"output_tokens":169,"latency_s":120.6985525,"cost_usd":0.0}],"latency_s":124.82248479999998,"parse_error":null}}
